cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the associated dataset when using the methods."
type: software
title: "CSI-MAIZE: circular phenotyping and leaf-scale architectural experiments"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Galic
    given-names: Vlatko
    affiliation: Agricultural Institute Osijek
  - family-names: Mazur
    given-names: Maja
    affiliation: Agricultural Institute Osijek
repository-code: "https://github.com/vlattko/CSI-maize-methods"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible methods for circular maize imaging, source-assisted leaf geometry,
  known-answer inverse recovery, fixed-receiver architectural interventions,
  camera correspondence and spatial image descriptors. Anatomical, longitudinal
  and physiological validation boundaries are retained explicitly.
